WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:03.584
Build three Value Connections from checked capabilities. In

00:00:03.627 --> 00:00:06.059
our fictional case, the capability is a reviewed

00:00:06.101 --> 00:00:09.899
proposal workflow. The context is an incomplete proposal

00:00:09.941 --> 00:00:12.587
draft. The people include the reviewer and the

00:00:12.629 --> 00:00:15.052
person relying on the date. The observed improvement

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.442
is that the revised fictional draft flags the

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:20.044
missing date instead of inventing it. The evidence

00:00:20.215 --> 00:00:23.372
includes the input, first draft, correction and revised

00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:26.657
walkthrough. A second connection concerns a clearer reviewer

00:00:26.743 --> 00:00:31.321
handoff. A third concerns reusable review guidance. Select

00:00:31.407 --> 00:00:33.497
the two best supported by the retained work

00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:36.057
and explain your choice. Do not claim a

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.148
real team already benefited when the test was

00:00:38.191 --> 00:00:41.408
fictional. A possible future benefit stays a possible

00:00:41.579 --> 00:00:45.462
benefit until the intended setting has evidence. Keep

00:00:45.547 --> 00:00:48.307
the people, conditions and limits visible.
